// ADMIN added for Business v1 (team operations) — see BusinessMember below
// and src/lib/authorization.ts. v1 deliberately keeps team-management
// actions (invite/remove/role-change) OWNER-only regardless of ADMIN vs
// STAFF; ADMIN exists as a distinct, assignable label now so a future phase
// can grant it real additional operational permissions without another
// enum migration, but no route currently treats ADMIN differently from
// STAFF — see the Business Phase 1 report's "role model" section.
